  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Dimensions of L is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Dimensions of C is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And dimensions of R is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Clearly, dimensions of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>T</mi></mfenced></math>,</p><p>Dimensions&nbsp;of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>T</mi></mfenced></math>,</p><p>Dimensions of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>T</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and</p><p>Dimensions of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>",
